Third-party material
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

src/novatrees/chm_watershed.py is a Python port of the crown-detection stage
of Point-Cloud-Tools (PCT):

  Yrttimaa, T. (2021). Automatic Point Cloud Processing Tools to Characterize
  Trees (Point-Cloud-Tools). Zenodo. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.5779288
  Licensed CC BY 4.0.

  Methods described in:
  Yrttimaa et al. (2019), https://doi.org/10.3390/rs11121423
  Yrttimaa et al. (2020), https://doi.org/10.1016/j.isprsjprs.2020.08.017

That file is a derivative work and remains under CC BY 4.0; this repository
adopts the same licence so the terms stay compatible and the attribution
above travels with it.

The following are used as dependencies, not included or modified here, and
are governed by their own licences:

  TreeAIBox / TreeisoNet   Natural Resources Canada
  3DFin, dendromatics      the 3DFin developers
  CSF                      Zhang, Qi et al.
  CloudCompare and CloudCompare-PythonRuntime
  marimo, laspy, scikit-learn, scipy, matplotlib, xarray and others

No course material, slides or point cloud data are distributed in this
repository; those remain the property of their respective owners.
